WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.180
The roof must provide more shade than

00:00:02.180 --> 00:00:02.660
sunlight.

00:00:03.020 --> 00:00:04.620
Inspect what is really there.

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:06.720
Awareness comes before adjustment,

00:00:07.080 --> 00:00:09.360
just as noticing a routine comes before

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:10.060
changing it.
